Description: Global faecal sludge emptying demand data for 175 countries and
    territories, based on 2017 population figures. Demand is quantified by the
    population served by one of four emptying methods (mechanized,
    non-mechanized, unemptiable, no facility). The demand is disaggregated into
    urban and rural proportions.
